        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Entretien et affûtage",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "collapse_icon_style": "standard",
            "collapse_icon_radius": 15,
            "animation_speed": 0.4,
            "border_type": "bottom",
            "border_thickness": 1,
            "border_style": "solid",
            "corner_radius": 8,
            "enable_custom_style": false,
            "heading_padding_vertical": 12,
            "heading_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "content_padding_vertical": 10,
            "content_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "closed_state_border": "#dddddd",
            "closed_state_header_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_header_text": "#121212",
            "closed_state_row_icon": "#121212",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon": "#121212",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "closed_state_collapse_bg": "#121212",
            "closed_state_content_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "open_colors_on_hover": true,
            "open_state_border": "#d5aeea",
            "open_state_header_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_header_text": "#000000",
            "open_state_row_icon": "#6d388b",
            "open_state_collapse_icon": "#121212",
            "open_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#6d388b",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>Lavez la lame à la main, à l'eau tiède, et séchez-la immédiatement. Le damas n'est pas inoxydable : l'eau qui stagne le marque.</p><p>Jamais au lave-vaisselle, jamais laissée dans l'évier.</p><p>Un passage sur pierre 1000 puis 6000 tous les deux à trois mois suffit à garder le fil. Si vous préférez ne pas vous en occuper, renvoyez-nous la lame : l'affûtage est gratuit à vie.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "da_specs": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- liquid\n  assign s = product.metafields.specs\n-%}\n{%- capture rows -%}\n  {%- if s.acier != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Acier</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.acier }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.couches != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Couches</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.couches }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.durete_hrc != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Dureté</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.durete_hrc }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.angle != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Angle d'affûtage</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.angle }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.longueur_lame != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Longueur de lame</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.longueur_lame }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.poids != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Poids</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.poids }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n  {%- if s.manche != blank -%}<li class=\"da-specs__row\"><span class=\"da-specs__key\">Manche</span><span class=\"da-specs__value\">{{ s.manche }}</span></li>{%- endif -%}\n{%- endcapture -%}\n{%- if rows != blank -%}\n  <ul class=\"da-specs\">{{ rows }}</ul>\n{%- endif -%}"
          }
        },
        "recu": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Ce que vous recevez",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
